# Unik Fire — enemy air unit, id 38 (`Unik_4`): carriage with a BURNING stone bomb in a Sprite at (+34, +15).
# Rig transcribed verbatim from the decompiled `com.enemy.Unik_4.init()`
# (session export of design/noAds.swf):
#
#   d1 Sprite: x = 34;  y = 15;
#     Burn1   : y += 26;  x -= 29;  rotation = 90  -> unit origin (+5, +41)
#     Stoneb  : x -= (w>>1)+45;  y -= (h>>1)-21;   -> unit centre (-10.5, +36.5)
#     Littlebg: x -= (w>>1)+45;  y -= (h>>1)-26;   -> unit centre (-10.5, +41.5)
#
# Offsets are Flash (y-DOWN) relative to the UNIT ORIGIN; bitmaps are placed by
# their TOP-LEFT and then centred, so the lines above resolve each to a CENTRE.
# This prefab's ROOT is a Group2D at the unit origin, so every child is just
# flipped to pix3 y-up:  pix3 = (fx, -fy).  The carriage weapon is nested
# under `Unik Gondola` and so is additionally offset by [1.5, 22.5].
#
# Per-id stats (hp/speed/score/attack) are applied by WaveSpawner from SdBalance.
# GENERATED by scripts/gen-levels.mjs — edit the rig table there, not this file.
version: 1.0.0
